[183.466881, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.466963, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.467321, "o", "The specification requires that for a prediction at time ``t`` we use the latest snapshot\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.467381, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.467775, "o", "with ``snapshot_date < date(t)`` (the snapshot dated the same day as ``t`` is not visible).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.467829, "o", "> "]
[183.468222, "o", "The original implementation returned the globally latest snapshot per customer, causing\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.46828, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.468696, "o", "leakage. This implementation removes any timezone information from ``as_of`` and uses\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.469005, "o", "``merge_asof`` on the day level to enforce the half‑open rule.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.469052, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.469091, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.469134, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.469172, "o", "> "]
[183.46931, "o", "from __future__ import annotations\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.469499, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> import pandas as pd\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.469552, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.469599, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.469639, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.469856, "o", "def _make_naive(series: pd.Series) -> pd.Series:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.469906, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.470094, "o", "    \"\"\"Return a timezone‑naive series.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.470144, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.470184, "o", "> "]
[183.470562, "o", "    If the series is tz‑aware, convert to UTC then drop the tz; otherwise return as‑is.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.470606, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.470639, "o", "    \"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.470679, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.470832, "o", "    if series.dt.tz is not None:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.470895, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.471141, "o", "        # Convert to UTC then drop timezone information\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.471188, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.471226, "o", "> "]
[183.471477, "o", "        return series.dt.tz_convert(\"UTC\").dt.tz_localize(None)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.47152, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.471603, "o", "    return series\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.471643, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.4717, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.471738, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.472091, "o", "def latest_status(points: pd.DataFrame, snapshots: pd.DataFrame) -> pd.Series:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.472134, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.472179, "o", "> "]
[183.472488, "o", "    \"\"\"Return the status for each prediction respecting the half‑open rule.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.472538, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.472582, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.472652, "o", "    Parameters\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.472695, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.472763, "o", "    ----------\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.472814, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.473224, "o", "    points: DataFrame with ``customer_id`` and ``as_of`` (datetime, possibly tz‑aware).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.473267, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.473311, "o", "> "]
[183.473705, "o", "    snapshots: DataFrame with ``customer_id``, ``snapshot_date`` (date string) and ``status``.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.473766, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>     \"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.473809, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.474147, "o", "    # Ensure snapshot dates are naive (they represent calendar dates)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.474195, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.47434, "o", "    snapshots = snapshots.copy()\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.474394, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.474793, "o", "    snapshots[\"snapshot_date\"] = pd.to_datetime(snapshots[\"snapshot_date\"]).dt.normalize()\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.474836, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n"]
[183.474884, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.475222, "o", "    # Make ``as_of`` naive (strip any timezone) and compute the floor day\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.475325, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.475402, "o", "> "]
[183.47545, "o", "    points = points.copy()\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.475495, "o", "> "]
[183.475675, "o", "    points[\"as_of\"] = _make_naive(points[\"as_of\"])\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.475718, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.475772, "o", "> "]
[183.476039, "o", "    points_day = points.assign(day=points[\"as_of\"].dt.floor(\"D\"))\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.476137, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.476195, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.476246, "o", "    # Sort for merge_asof\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.476307, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.476569, "o", "    points_day = points_day.sort_values([\"customer_id\", \"day\"])\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.476612, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.476942, "o", "    snapshots = snapshots.sort_values([\"customer_id\", \"snapshot_date\"])\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.476966, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.477011, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.47704, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.477157, "o", "    merged = pd.merge_asof(\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.477194, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.477298, "o", "        points_day,\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.477334, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.477425, "o", "        snapshots,\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.477462, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.47757, "o", "        left_on=\"day\",\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.477601, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.477636, "o", "> "]
[183.477774, "o", "        right_on=\"snapshot_date\",\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.477818, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.477944, "o", "        by=\"customer_id\",\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.477985, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.478123, "o", "        direction=\"backward\",\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.478158, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.478329, "o", "        allow_exact_matches=False,\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.478367, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.478401, "o", ">     )\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.478435, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.478573, "o", "    return merged[\"status\"]\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.478608, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.478642, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.478676, "o", "> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.480437, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
