[438.708394, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[438.708727, "o", "label became available. According to ``FEATURES.md`` a label row is only usable for a prediction at\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[438.708766, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[438.708802, "o", "> "]
[438.709116, "o", "time ``t`` if ``label_available_at < t``. The encoding must therefore be recomputed per prediction\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
